menu "Smart blinds Wi-Fi evaluation"
    config SB_WIFI_PLAINTEXT_DISPOSABLE_BENCH
        bool "Permit disposable bench credentials without flash encryption"
        default n
        help
            Explicit bench-only exception for disposable keys and a test AP.
            Default requires already enabled flash encryption. This firmware
            does not provision keys, burn eFuses or enable flash encryption.
            Never use this exception for the owner's network or production keys.
endmenu
